WEBVTT

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:42.630
That professor mumbles so 
much it's hard to hear him.

00:00:44.090 --> 00:00:47.140
You can't understand what he's saying!

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:51.780
I fell in love with you at 
first sight on a genetic level.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:53.820
Please marry me.

00:00:53.820 --> 00:00:54.680
Impossible

00:01:00.260 --> 00:01:01.650
Wait!

00:01:02.060 --> 00:01:03.650
I could just see it!

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:06.010
You and me, as a family!

00:01:06.340 --> 00:01:07.910
Is this fate?

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.100
No, it's a miracle!

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.170
Please, marry me.

00:01:10.400 --> 00:01:11.170
Impossible.

00:01:12.410 --> 00:01:14.840
I don't know if you should 
just decide something's

00:01:14.840 --> 00:01:16.840
impossible without really considering it.

00:01:17.180 --> 00:01:21.360
Even if it's 99% impossible, 
there's still that 1% chance!

00:01:21.360 --> 00:01:22.890
It's 5000% impossible.

00:01:27.230 --> 00:01:29.370
You sure? He's pretty cute.

00:01:29.750 --> 00:01:31.360
If it's impossible, it's impossible.

00:01:31.360 --> 00:01:33.430
You're so harsh, Gina.

00:01:41.860 --> 00:01:42.980
Gina...

00:01:45.540 --> 00:01:47.390
<i>Asimov is badly injured by Liu's poison,</i>

00:01:47.390 --> 00:01:49.500
<i>but tries to sacrifice himself 
for one final attack.</i>

00:01:49.900 --> 00:01:51.590
<i>Alexander rushes to his aid.</i>

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.380
<i>A brutal battle ensues.</i>

00:01:54.870 --> 00:01:58.180
<i>Suddenly, a huge army 
of terraformars attacks.</i>

00:01:58.770 --> 00:02:01.800
<i>The crew of No. 3 Division are 
taken out one after another.</i>

00:02:02.610 --> 00:02:06.100
<i>Their goal was Annex 1 as well.</i>

00:02:11.160 --> 00:02:12.490
<i>The Annex...</i>

00:02:35.170 --> 00:02:36.480
Everyone, get out of here!

00:02:36.480 --> 00:02:37.780
That's a bacteria type!

00:02:39.220 --> 00:02:40.490
<i>Nuclear Weapons.</i>

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:41.820
<i>Biological weapons.</i>

00:02:41.820 --> 00:02:43.150
<i>Chemical Weapons.</i>

00:02:43.850 --> 00:02:45.790
<i>Together, they are referred 
to as NBC weapons,</i>

00:02:45.790 --> 00:02:47.590
<i>and their use is drastically restricted.</i>

00:02:48.880 --> 00:02:52.900
<i>Branch Office 4 came up with 
the technology to use them.</i>

00:02:54.150 --> 00:03:00.110
<i>That explains why the No. 4 Division's got a 
girl with them who clearly isn't a soldier!</i>

00:04:48.180 --> 00:04:49.100
We're retreating!

00:04:49.590 --> 00:04:51.230
Hurry, hurry, hurry!

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:56.060
Sasha.

00:04:56.690 --> 00:04:57.650
Bao-kun.

00:04:58.130 --> 00:04:59.710
They're escaping via a tunnel?

00:05:00.160 --> 00:05:01.740
I expected that though!

00:05:04.280 --> 00:05:05.610
Sasha!

00:05:07.330 --> 00:05:08.080
Captain!

00:05:09.110 --> 00:05:10.410
I'll protect you!

00:05:10.410 --> 00:05:12.240
M.A.R.S. Ranking 20
Anastasia Andreevna Politkovskaya
Russian Northern European No. 3 Division
Surgery Base: Trapdoor Spider

00:05:15.700 --> 00:05:16.920
I don't know.

00:05:17.870 --> 00:05:19.280
A trapdoor spider?

00:05:19.280 --> 00:05:21.340
We couldn't get them, huh?

00:05:21.860 --> 00:05:24.900
They're a dangerous group to have 
standing at our backs.

00:05:33.950 --> 00:05:37.010
Soldier And Father

00:05:43.920 --> 00:05:45.360
What's wrong, Berke?

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:48.450
Not being able to use
 my nose makes me nervous.

00:05:48.870 --> 00:05:49.700
Yeah.

00:05:49.700 --> 00:05:50.840
I'm sure.

00:05:52.050 --> 00:05:54.140
Let's regroup.

00:05:54.140 --> 00:05:55.370
Call Hong-chan.

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:04.630
Wait! Wait, wait!

00:06:04.960 --> 00:06:07.880
Senpai... Alexander-senpai is still...

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:12.160
What's this?

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:15.460
Someone other than us is inside the ship.

00:06:16.270 --> 00:06:19.920
But they shouldn't be able to even 
get close without protective suits.

00:06:19.920 --> 00:06:22.520
They're probably prepared to die.

00:06:23.020 --> 00:06:27.370
They must be that pissed off at us.

00:06:28.340 --> 00:06:30.540
Rank 3 and Rank 10 ran into the hole.

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:33.410
It's Rank 7 who's inside the ship.

00:06:33.730 --> 00:06:35.370
Wh-When did they...

00:06:35.370 --> 00:06:36.690
They're using explosives?

00:06:36.690 --> 00:06:37.740
Calm down.

00:06:38.270 --> 00:06:41.300
We've got all the bombs.

00:06:41.940 --> 00:06:43.380
That explosion sound was this.

00:06:43.970 --> 00:06:46.120
A burst fire extinguisher.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:49.390
He was just knocked out with 
the fire extinguisher, is all.

00:06:50.350 --> 00:06:53.300
He put on a show to try and terrify us.

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.040
How Russian.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:07:00.470
He's got talent, 
making booby traps with one hand.

00:07:00.470 --> 00:07:02.190
But there's just one of him.

00:07:02.870 --> 00:07:06.650
And he can't survive very 
long in here without a suit.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:10.300
If he knows that, and he came here anyway,

00:07:10.800 --> 00:07:13.480
we can't just ignore him, can we?

00:07:20.520 --> 00:07:21.720
<i>Shit.</i>

00:07:22.130 --> 00:07:25.460
<i>If this was a movie, this would be 
a sign the hero was about to die.</i>

00:07:27.800 --> 00:07:30.800
<i>I'm doomed. No chance of victory.</i>

00:07:31.360 --> 00:07:33.270
<i>5000% impossible.</i>

00:07:42.850 --> 00:07:45.400
Hey, Gina!

00:07:47.640 --> 00:07:49.400
Okay, I'll be going.

00:07:51.810 --> 00:07:53.560
You again?

00:07:53.560 --> 00:07:55.490
You don't have to get back to the army?

00:07:55.800 --> 00:07:57.870
I'm on a long leave right now.

00:07:58.220 --> 00:08:00.460
Then go home.

00:08:00.840 --> 00:08:03.140
Your parents must be worried, right?

00:08:03.140 --> 00:08:05.330
I don't even know what my parents look like.

00:08:08.180 --> 00:08:08.710
Sor—

00:08:08.710 --> 00:08:09.510
Gina!

00:08:10.020 --> 00:08:11.510
Marry me!

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:15.830
I told you.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.870
That's 5000% impossible.

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:23.290
Even if you're serious, my father will 
8000% never let me marry a Russian soldier.

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:25.960
<b>Actually, just having
 a boyfriend would be
 200% impossible.</b>

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:27.440
Actually, just having a boyfriend 
would be 200% impossible.

00:08:28.010 --> 00:08:30.750
Then let me meet your dad!

00:08:38.150 --> 00:08:39.920
This is my dad.

00:08:41.160 --> 00:08:42.290
This is...

00:08:43.390 --> 00:08:46.540
Sylvester Asimov, the invincible war god?

00:08:46.870 --> 00:08:47.740
Yup.

00:08:47.740 --> 00:08:50.340
The mortal enemy of you Russian soldiers.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:52.260
H-Hello—

00:09:01.860 --> 00:09:04.640
I apologize for coming 
by so suddenly yesterday,

00:09:05.250 --> 00:09:05.850
Fath—

00:09:07.030 --> 00:09:09.170
You look like a playboy.

00:09:11.440 --> 00:09:12.360
Good morn—

00:09:13.580 --> 00:09:15.600
Short hair's not a good look 
for you. Let's shave it off.

00:09:18.420 --> 00:09:19.080
Hel—

00:09:22.670 --> 00:09:25.380
He won't even speak to me...

00:09:26.250 --> 00:09:27.420
Want to give up?

00:09:28.100 --> 00:09:29.180
No!

00:09:34.050 --> 00:09:35.370
You're so stubborn.

00:09:40.560 --> 00:09:42.680
Come here. I need to patch you up.

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:57.340
I'm getting a lot more injury pay.

00:09:59.680 --> 00:10:00.410
Good morning!

00:10:02.750 --> 00:10:04.380
You're getting on my nerves!

00:10:05.230 --> 00:10:07.090
You spoke to me for the first time.

00:10:07.090 --> 00:10:08.040
Go home!

00:10:08.040 --> 00:10:10.380
Dad! At least hear him out!

00:10:10.380 --> 00:10:12.400
I said go home.

00:10:12.400 --> 00:10:14.620
I'm not interested in talking to him.

00:10:14.620 --> 00:10:17.620
Honey, it wouldn't hurt to 
have some tea, would it?

00:10:19.110 --> 00:10:21.260
No, but...

00:10:21.260 --> 00:10:23.140
Enough!

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:27.800
You stubborn old man!

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:31.230
<i>They're overpowering him...</i>

00:10:29.920 --> 00:10:32.340
You can at least give him a chance!

00:10:32.060 --> 00:10:36.180
<i>Him, the War God Asimov who even the 
Russian military couldn't defeat!</i>

00:10:41.170 --> 00:10:44.120
<i>I don't remember what happened after that.</i>

00:10:44.570 --> 00:10:47.700
<i>Because it was just so...</i>

00:10:49.400 --> 00:10:50.570
Alexander.

00:10:50.570 --> 00:10:52.540
I have one thing to say to you.

00:10:52.540 --> 00:10:53.850
Yes, sir!

00:10:54.300 --> 00:10:55.500
Listen.

00:10:55.730 --> 00:10:58.380
I'll be teaching my grandson judo!

00:10:58.380 --> 00:10:59.440
Yes, sir!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:04.720
What are you saying? He's not even born yet!

00:11:04.720 --> 00:11:07.620
Fool! It's important to 
start your education early!

00:11:07.620 --> 00:11:08.650
It's too soon!

00:11:08.980 --> 00:11:10.180
It must've been cold out there.

00:11:10.510 --> 00:11:12.190
I'll get you some warm tea, okay?

00:11:12.420 --> 00:11:13.870
Thank you.

00:11:14.210 --> 00:11:15.260
Welcome back.

00:11:15.780 --> 00:11:17.220
Listen.

00:11:17.220 --> 00:11:19.600
He's kicking a lot today.

00:11:19.600 --> 00:11:21.280
It actually hurts.

00:11:24.860 --> 00:11:25.890
What's wrong?

00:11:27.170 --> 00:11:29.080
No, it just feels like...

00:11:29.080 --> 00:11:31.960
Is it okay for me to come in?

00:11:33.970 --> 00:11:35.770
Of course.

00:11:35.770 --> 00:11:36.800
We're family.

00:11:38.790 --> 00:11:40.480
Come on.

00:11:41.480 --> 00:11:43.720
<i>It was just so...</i>

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:47.000
<i>So much like a dream.</i>

00:11:57.410 --> 00:11:58.310
<i>Gina.</i>

00:12:00.190 --> 00:12:02.450
They won't last two years, I've heard.

00:12:02.930 --> 00:12:06.160
Not just your grandson, 
but your daughter, as well.

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:11.470
There is only one way to save your 
daughter, who is a Russian citizen.

00:12:12.390 --> 00:12:13.790
Of course, there's a risk.

00:12:14.220 --> 00:12:18.560
It will mean that you yourself have 
to betray your old companions.

00:12:19.450 --> 00:12:20.920
<i>That's right, Dad.</i>

00:12:21.330 --> 00:12:22.970
<i>This is wrong.</i>

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.180
I'm uninterested in platitudes,

00:12:26.060 --> 00:12:27.910
nor do I plan to pretend 
what I'm doing is right.

00:12:28.780 --> 00:12:34.940
I'll sell out the rest of the 
world to save my daughter and grandson.

00:12:35.210 --> 00:12:40.590
And I won't let my son lose 
his family a second time.

00:12:45.720 --> 00:12:46.770
<i>Dad...</i>

00:12:55.020 --> 00:12:57.190
<i>Dad, I'm almost there.</i>

00:12:59.590 --> 00:13:00.800
What is this?

00:13:03.120 --> 00:13:03.910
Where is he?

00:13:14.320 --> 00:13:15.690
Hong! This way!

00:13:18.520 --> 00:13:20.940
<i>I'll take this place back and save Gina!</i>

00:13:23.780 --> 00:13:24.970
Wiped out?

00:13:25.650 --> 00:13:26.680
That's impossible!

00:13:26.680 --> 00:13:28.980
Rank 7 or not, he was alone,

00:13:28.980 --> 00:13:30.950
had one arm, and was almost dead!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:32.890
What's the Rank 7's base?

00:13:32.890 --> 00:13:34.990
Dorcus titanus titanus.

00:13:35.580 --> 00:13:38.200
His claws are sharper 
than his boss, the crab,

00:13:38.200 --> 00:13:40.250
but they're lighter and can't regenerate.

00:13:40.910 --> 00:13:42.480
It's a very ordinary base.

00:14:02.150 --> 00:14:03.100
<i>A child?</i>

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.910
You're the only one not 
wearing protective gear.

00:14:06.320 --> 00:14:08.050
You're the bacteria type.

00:14:09.000 --> 00:14:11.280
As long as you use your powers here,

00:14:11.780 --> 00:14:17.540
my dad and the others won't be able 
to use the research facilities.

00:14:18.220 --> 00:14:20.180
I'm uninterested in platitudes,

00:14:20.770 --> 00:14:22.490
nor do I plan to pretend 
what I'm doing is right.

00:14:23.050 --> 00:14:26.000
Russia will be the first to make 
that vaccine if it kills me.

00:14:26.740 --> 00:14:29.470
I'll protect my family.

00:14:29.470 --> 00:14:30.810
That's all.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:35.930
<b>Anti-Terraformars Ballistic Spetznaz Jaw Knife  "Kavkaz Kalinka"

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.390
Sir, let's head back!

00:14:38.390 --> 00:14:40.070
We need to save him!

00:14:40.470 --> 00:14:41.400
No.

00:14:41.400 --> 00:14:42.770
We'll just die, too.

00:14:42.770 --> 00:14:43.670
But...

00:14:43.670 --> 00:14:44.730
That's an order!

00:14:44.730 --> 00:14:45.400
Keep walking!

00:14:56.400 --> 00:14:58.620
Dad, I'm going, too.

00:14:59.760 --> 00:15:02.500
Take me to Mars with you.

00:15:03.360 --> 00:15:05.580
I'll save Gina, save my family,

00:15:06.170 --> 00:15:07.510
if it kills me!

00:15:08.810 --> 00:15:09.970
Fool.

00:15:10.720 --> 00:15:13.260
If you die, Gina will be sad.

00:15:16.310 --> 00:15:17.380
This is an order.

00:15:17.900 --> 00:15:19.020
Don't let anything kill you.

00:15:20.710 --> 00:15:21.530
Yes, sir.

00:15:22.860 --> 00:15:24.330
Let's go, Sasha.

00:15:24.850 --> 00:15:25.750
Okay!

00:15:27.780 --> 00:15:29.230
<i>My son's a fool.</i>

00:15:31.100 --> 00:15:32.700
Where is he?

00:15:32.700 --> 00:15:34.400
What is this smoke?

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:35.510
A fire extinguisher?

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:36.750
That's not all.

00:15:36.750 --> 00:15:37.910
Terraformars.

00:15:38.230 --> 00:15:41.170
He burned their internal 
organs to generate smoke.

00:15:41.440 --> 00:15:42.340
Damn it.

00:15:42.340 --> 00:15:43.920
If I could only use my nose.

00:15:43.920 --> 00:15:47.700
We can't use our powers 
fully with these suits on.

00:15:48.230 --> 00:15:49.130
Hong...

00:15:58.980 --> 00:16:00.150
<i>Do it!</i>

00:16:00.520 --> 00:16:03.040
<i>It doesn't matter if she's a kid.</i>

00:16:03.810 --> 00:16:05.820
<i>Save Gina!</i>

00:16:06.480 --> 00:16:07.910
My major?

00:16:07.910 --> 00:16:10.280
Education. Early childhood education.

00:16:11.290 --> 00:16:13.280
Kids are cute, right?

00:16:13.640 --> 00:16:16.960
Russians, East Europeans, Chinese...

00:16:17.420 --> 00:16:21.250
before they turn into muscleheads 
like you, every child is cute.

00:16:23.160 --> 00:16:24.480
They sure are.

00:16:57.130 --> 00:16:58.490
I've found you!

00:17:00.380 --> 00:17:04.190
You think we aren't prepared to die?

00:17:08.160 --> 00:17:10.370
Berke, we'll handle the rest.

00:17:12.660 --> 00:17:14.550
Hiding in the smoke won't save you.

00:17:14.920 --> 00:17:16.530
No matter where you hide,

00:17:16.530 --> 00:17:22.220
my omni-directional sonar 
"Cryptocentrus cinctus" will find you!

00:17:26.990 --> 00:17:28.650
Xi, to your right!

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:36.600
<i>It was empty?</i>

00:17:36.940 --> 00:17:38.070
<i>Where's the real one?</i>

00:17:46.650 --> 00:17:50.000
<i>It's that woman who can turn transparent?</i>

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:53.000
<i>If she can regenerate limbs,</i>

00:17:53.000 --> 00:17:54.250
<i>that means she's a type of squid?!</i>

00:17:55.350 --> 00:17:57.160
<i>Those are earrings?</i>

00:17:59.470 --> 00:18:01.610
<i>Then I can cut off her head!</i>

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:12.230
I can't let you kill Hong!

00:18:24.840 --> 00:18:27.260
<i>That's Rank 99?</i>

00:18:27.260 --> 00:18:28.260
<i>Hah!</i>

00:18:32.930 --> 00:18:34.470
How many seconds was that?

00:18:34.470 --> 00:18:36.010
I need my protective gear.

00:18:50.340 --> 00:18:52.240
Even...

00:18:52.240 --> 00:18:53.660
Even if I die...

00:18:54.460 --> 00:18:56.560
Even if I die, I'll get that vaccine.

00:18:59.810 --> 00:19:04.020
I'll defeat you, call 
my dad and the others...

00:19:07.750 --> 00:19:08.710
Gina...

00:19:09.960 --> 00:19:12.160
And save Gina...

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:15.860
Gina...

00:19:18.120 --> 00:19:18.970
My...

00:19:21.260 --> 00:19:22.330
family...

00:19:29.070 --> 00:19:29.890
Xi!

00:19:29.890 --> 00:19:30.890
His body!

00:19:34.100 --> 00:19:36.590
Jet, kill us both!

00:19:44.330 --> 00:19:47.790
You're beyond saving...

00:19:47.790 --> 00:19:49.300
You idiot! Ru—

00:19:49.300 --> 00:19:50.030
I...

00:19:50.880 --> 00:19:54.900
I don't know anything about 
the government, or about you,

00:19:55.730 --> 00:19:56.720
but...

00:19:57.730 --> 00:20:00.420
Please don't kill Xi-san!

00:20:04.530 --> 00:20:05.310
Xi...

00:20:06.040 --> 00:20:07.520
Put on your protective gear.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:09.930
It's been over a minute.

00:20:14.170 --> 00:20:15.110
He's...

00:20:16.330 --> 00:20:17.800
already dead.

00:20:26.440 --> 00:20:27.570
Senpai!

00:20:32.240 --> 00:20:34.420
We've lost so many men.

00:20:34.420 --> 00:20:38.190
And our other missile platform 
was destroyed as well.

00:20:39.110 --> 00:20:44.180
Rank 7's resolve went far beyond 
what I expected, it seemed.

00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:45.420
Sheesh...

00:20:46.110 --> 00:20:47.680
This is a disaster.

00:20:48.470 --> 00:20:50.910
Isn't this impossible to understand, Bao?

00:20:51.410 --> 00:20:52.290
Well...

00:20:53.030 --> 00:20:54.140
Yeah.

00:20:55.100 --> 00:20:57.410
He knew he was going to die.

00:20:57.410 --> 00:21:00.180
And even if he got back 
the research facilities,

00:21:00.180 --> 00:21:02.610
it wasn't going to save his wife immediately.

00:21:03.350 --> 00:21:06.070
Depending on how you look 
at it, he died for nothing.

00:21:06.470 --> 00:21:10.040
But that's how it is for everyone who fights.

00:21:10.450 --> 00:21:14.000
They have something they want to 
protect even if it kills them.

00:21:15.380 --> 00:21:17.260
Rank 7 was strong.

00:21:17.770 --> 00:21:19.460
I don't like fighting people like him,

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:22.810
who are willing to die for 
the reason they fight.

00:21:24.320 --> 00:21:29.110
No matter what, we must show 
respect for those who fought.

00:21:29.810 --> 00:21:34.440
Even if we did whatever 
we had to in order to kill them.

00:21:35.740 --> 00:21:38.410
We've got one missile launcher left.

00:21:38.850 --> 00:21:41.360
We'll only be able to fire 
one missile at a time.

00:21:41.360 --> 00:21:44.860
That gives No. 1 and No. 2 
division a lot of options.

00:21:45.120 --> 00:21:47.830
Yeah, that's bad enough.

00:21:47.830 --> 00:21:50.080
But what's worse is the way this was destroyed.

00:21:51.450 --> 00:21:53.960
<i>This wasn't Rank 7's weapon.</i>

00:21:54.920 --> 00:22:00.070
<i>There's only one weapon 
that can cut like this...</i>

00:23:35.930 --> 00:23:40.940
Weapons and Techniques

00:23:37.940 --> 00:23:40.500
His name was Hizamaru.
